{30}{My name doesn't matter. I'm a man praying to stay lucid. All my companions let themselves slip into madness. Prayer alone makes me hold.}{My name doesn't matter. I'm a man praying to stay lucid. All my companions let themselves slip into madness. Prayer alone makes me hold.}{}{}{}{}
