{60}{Long is the story of our epic... We arrived in the valley a long time ago. At that time, the places were welcoming and we settled here to live. There were about ten of us. Over time, some began to switch to madness. None of us could finally survive as the valley became hostile to us.}{Long is the story of our epic... We arrived in the valley a long time ago. At that time, the places were welcoming and we settled here to live. There were about ten of us. Over time, some began to switch to madness. None of us could finally survive as the valley became hostile to us.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{[Further]}{}{1}{}{62}{}

{62}{There is a curse on this valley, I am convinced. She keeps us prisoners, even after death...}{There is a curse on this valley, I am convinced. She keeps us prisoners, even after death...}{}{}{}{}
