{120}{In my opinion, the only way out is to pass under the mountains surrounding the valley. You'll get through the old tomb. Find the stone key from the tomb and bring me back. The castellan has it.}{In my opinion, the only way out is to pass under the mountains surrounding the valley. You'll get through the old tomb. Find the stone key and bring me back. The castellan has it.}{}{}{}{qu1500 2}
