{180}{That's the key to the tomb. It opens the stone door. You have to be able to push it... The strongest of the ogres would not succeed. Now you have to find a companion to help you open the door. Needless to say, in this role, a spectrum will not serve you much...}{That's the key to the tomb. It opens the stone door. You have to be able to push it... The strongest of the ogres would not succeed. Now you have to find a companion to help you open the door. Needless to say, in this role, a spectrum will not serve you much...}{}{}{}{qu1501 2}
